'''8Key'''<ref name="Design Origin">{{SW|url=news/designing-star-wars-resistance|text=Designing ''Star Wars'': ''Star Wars Resistance''|author=[[Kristin Baver]]|date=2019-03-11}} {{C|Slide 12}}</ref> was a business advertised on the chassis of [[R4-G77]],<ref name="Unmotivated">{{Resistance|Unmotivated}}</ref> an [[astromech droid]] owned by [[Hype Fazon]], a [[racer]] [[pilot]] on the ''[[Colossus]]'' [[Fuel|refueling]] [[Space station|station]].<ref name="Recruit">{{Resistance|The Recruit}}</ref> The business logo was written in [[Aurebesh]], with the number 8 presented in a [[Alternative Aurebesh numerals|special numeral script]], although each character was flipped upside-down.<ref name="Design Origin" />

